## Stack

- **Backend:** Rust 2024 workspace (Rust 1.94+). Services on **axum 0.8** + **tokio**: every service in `services/` is a library with `build(ctx)` and a one-line binary; `app/` (`app-all`) links them all into one process connected by in-process bridges (the default), `BRIDGES=off` runs them as separate microservices (`docs/bridges.md`). Shared code in `crates/`. **SQLite** through **sqlx 0.9** (runtime queries with `?` parameters and static SQL strings — sqlx refuses SQL built at runtime; no compile-time query macros), migrations embedded in every service. reqwest (rustls) behind the bridges and for external APIs, argon2 for passwords, AES-GCM for secrets at rest.
- **Web:** **Vue 3** (`<script setup lang="ts">`), **Vite**, **Vue Router**, **Pinia**, **vue-i18n** (English and Russian), **Tailwind CSS 4** (liquid glass design, orange `accent-*` tokens, light/dark/system themes), lucide icons.
- **Tooling:** npm workspace `web`, TypeScript strict, ESLint, Prettier, Vitest; cargo clippy (`-D warnings`), rustfmt, `cargo test` (`wiremock` for HTTP).

